      "message": "Might be useful to say that ectool bypasses a lot of the kernel driver functionality. ectool sends raw packets directly (through the help of a lower level portion of cros-ec).\nIt\u0027s good because it allows quick testing/prototyping of functionality, but it\u0027s bad since it doesn\u0027t confirm that everything\u0027s sane.",
      "revId": "94ac435914a265233e2802a927be62839bade259",
